{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_bdhkgt_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_bdhkgt_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"最后的比武","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"截云想让铸剑坊重现之前师父和自己描绘的模样：有人比武，有人喝酒，大家不分彼此，一同歌唱。正巧，她遇上了两个醉酒的武人。","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_bdhkgt_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["巡防营守军A","巡防营守军B","截云","荆先生","半酣的武人","醉酒的武人","清醒的武人","左宣辽"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_35_g5_swordcastingworkshop.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sweep","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"这小姑娘，待在这里几天了......","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"她也没有闹事，只是打扫卫生，不算违背左将军的命令。就让她继续做吧。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":17},{"type":"dialog","id":18},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sweep","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#8$3","duration":"1","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"这沙子一会儿不扫就又落上一层......孟大叔之前，是时时都在打扫吗？","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#8$3","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"武器架、桌子、椅子都修好了，瓦片也贴回去了，炉火也点起来了......","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"这里看起来，和师父说的一模一样了。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":31},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":32},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"......","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"......你找我干什么？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"孟大叔走之后，他们说铸剑坊是你在管了。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"......师父生前总会提到这里，孟大叔也对我有恩，我想让这里变回原来的样子。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"他们说，我应该来找你。我能来帮忙，打扫，修补，我都行的。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"......","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"用不上，这里有我收拾就行了。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"变回原来的样子有什么用？不会再有人来这里了。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"该留不住的都是留不住的。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"charslot","id":54},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":55},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"截云抬起头，看着这座铸剑坊。","id":57},{"type":"text","text":"主人爱惜这里的一草一木、一桌一椅，器具用了多年都不曾换，她现在也修好了这里面有所残损的物件。","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"但人来来去去，最终只有自己一个人站在这里。","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"......不对，还是不一样，这还不是铸剑坊。","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"这里应该有人。有打架的人，有喝酒的人......","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":64},{"type":"charslot","id":65},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"我想问问，除了那个擂台，还有哪里能找来人打架吗？","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"......","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"不知道的话，你们能来和我打架吗？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"......肯定不能。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"那你们知道，哪里能找来人喝酒吗？","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"......","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"charslot","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":83},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_bg_35_g1_yumenstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":84},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"......都说了别喝这么多，你看你，走都走不稳了！","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"那又怎么样？反正都要走了，多喝点就多喝点......","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"......你也都看到了，擂台被天灾砸塌了，排行榜也不知道被谁收走了......走之前最后看一眼铸剑坊罢了。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":92},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"唉，看一眼就走吧......你难道还想着宗师、孟大哥还是哪个谁把你叫进去比武吗？","id":93,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":94},{"type":"charslot","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":96},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","duration":"1","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"......你们要来和我打一架吗？","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"......啊......？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"阿纳萨少女站在门口看着两人，她手上的飞轮和她的眼睛一样亮。她身后，巡防营的守军一脸无奈。","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#7$3","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"喂，你们会武功吧？你们可以和我打架，呃，比武吧？","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"......","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#7$3","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"你们特意走到这里来，就是来比武的吧？","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":111},{"type":"text","text":"阿纳萨少女显然没有开玩笑。两个武人看了她一眼后，面面相觑。","id":112},{"type":"text","text":"曾经，也有某个眉眼飞扬的女性像她这样走出来，这样叫住他们，这样大声地说：“快进来，让我看看你们几个练功偷懒了没有！”","id":113},{"type":"text","text":"曾经......","id":114},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"是啊——来！","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"左将军有令，这里不得进行任何——哎哎哎，你们——","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":120},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":121},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":122},{"type":"charslot","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":124},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_35_g5_swordcastingworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":125},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"擂台分两边，名号报在先。玉门多侠士，豪气震云天！在下人称“玉门二郎拳”张冲——请指教！","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"哈哈，在下“黄沙一字剑”第五十六代传人林飞沙！","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"还没请教姑娘来自哪门哪派！","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#6$3","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"我......","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FD/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#11$3","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"阿......阿纳萨，截云。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-11$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"这是干嘛，怎么还摆开架势了？","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"怎、怎么办？把闹事的抓起来？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":141},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"......我去把那两条凳子给挪开。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"啊？","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"比武的时候，得把擂台上的杂物都清干净，不是吗？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"......","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"text","text":"巡防营守军默默地撤出两步外，原本寂寥的小院重新响起挥拳的风声。","id":154},{"type":"text","text":"借着酒意与风中的黄沙，武人欺身而上，双拳挥击，试图压制住截云的武器。","id":155},{"type":"character","id":156},{"type":"dialog","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.5","id":158},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadetime":"0.6","block":"true","id":159},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":160},{"type":"playsound","key":"$fightgeneral","volume":"0.5","id":161},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punch","text":"","id":164},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"12","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"哈哈，这才对，这才对！擂台比武，四四方方，划好擂台范围，干干净净......","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"放屁！要说擂台规矩，你刚才伸手要干什么？别以为我不知道你的暗器！","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"暗器怎么了？暗器也是我实打实辛苦练的！你之前难道没被我的暗器救过命？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"既然是擂台比武，那就不能用暗器！","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"好好好......我不用，那按规矩，比武点到为止，你要给你的剑刃封上松蜡！","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#7$3","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"好，我给我的飞轮也封上。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#7$3","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"——再来！","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"再来！","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":183},{"type":"charslot","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"charslot","id":186},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":187},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_bg_35_g5_swordcastingworkshop.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"text","text":"几个回合过去，截云已经看出两人醉酒，下盘不稳，出手混乱，自己只需要一招就能把他们打出擂台范围。","id":190},{"type":"text","text":"但......","id":191},{"type":"text","text":"两个武人眼神越打越清明，越打越正经，仿佛这不是一场醉酒后随意的较量，而是一场真正的擂台比武......","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"即使他们的动作已经彻底走形。","id":193},{"type":"text","text":"她不由得放缓了自己的攻势。","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"哈哈！就说让你少喝点酒，这下不行了吧？","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"笑什么？继续！继续！","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"姑娘，比武就要尽兴尽力，我看出来了你在让着我们！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"这可不行！你得用你的全力！","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#7$3","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"......","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-7$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#5$3","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"——嗬！","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B0/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":209},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"50","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":210},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_skill_skulsrsword","id":211},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"——呜啊！","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"醉酒的武人","text":"咳咳咳......姑、姑娘这一手真漂亮！","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"好！打得好！......呃......","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"咳。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"charslot","id":223},{"type":"text","text":"截云抹了抹额头上的薄汗，炉火很旺，打架很费力气，所有人都热得满脸通红。","id":224},{"type":"text","text":"阿纳萨少女还未从比武中回过神，但她觉得现在就该喝酒了。","id":225},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":226,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"你们渴吗？","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"烈刀子，你们常喝的酒。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"playsound","key":"$pourwater","id":233},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":234},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"给。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"dialog","id":238},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":239},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","id":240},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","loop":"false","channel":"d1","delay":"1","id":241},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drinkswllw","loop":"false","channel":"d2","delay":"1.6","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":243},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"半酣的武人","text":"嗯，好香，好酒！","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"给。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"我们？","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"嗯。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"执勤期间，不能饮酒。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"......","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"姑娘，别一直举着了......军令在身......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"......","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"text","text":"阿纳萨少女递酒的手纹丝不动，酒碗里的烈刀子和她的眼睛一样清澈。","id":260},{"type":"text","text":"如果他不接，少女大概会一直和他耗着。","id":261},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"你——我——唉，好吧。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"师父说，像这样......请。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"text","text":"酒碗相撞，像是多年前那般发出同样清脆的声响，泼洒出的酒液浸湿了地上的沙砾。","id":268},{"type":"text","text":"几人站在铸剑坊的院子里，官兵和武人共同举碗，一仰头，喝干了手中的酒。","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"原来，是这个样子啊......","id":270},{"type":"dialog","id":271},{"type":"charslot","id":272},{"type":"text","text":"阿纳萨少女突然懂了。","id":273},{"type":"text","text":"她明白了为什么玉门人喜欢打架，为什么大家打完架还能和好如初，一起喝酒。","id":274},{"type":"text","text":"她明白了师父为什么这么喜欢这里。","id":275},{"type":"text","text":"截云弯下腰，拾起一小撮地上带着酒香的沙砾，放进自己随身的小包中。","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"师父，这里好像，就是你给我讲的铸剑坊了。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":279},{"type":"charslot","id":280},{"type":"text","text":"截云本想再说些什么，或者再和大家喝上一碗酒，或者像师父给自己描绘的那样，对着风沙和老槐树唱一首歌......","id":281},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"好了，陪你们闹了这一场，也差不多了。","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的武人","text":"是啊......","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的武人","text":"末班车队离城的时间也差不多到了，该走了。","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8F/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的武人","text":"走之前还能比这么一场武，没白来，没白来......","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_npc_797_1#1$1","id":290},{"type":"dialogue","name":"清醒的武人","text":"姑娘，江湖再见了，别忘了今天的比武，这可是玉门城最后的比武......","id":291,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_npc_797_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#8$3","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"“最后的”......","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-8$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#6$3","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"不对，欸，你们......","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FD/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"charslot","id":297},{"type":"text","text":"武人没有回应她。","id":298},{"type":"text","text":"两人站起了身，把碗放下，一边走一边拍打着身上的尘土，没有再回头。","id":299},{"type":"text","text":"截云看着他们的背影，他们走得很稳，仿佛刚刚没有喝过酒，没有醉过，刚刚的一切都没有发生。","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"为什么是“最后的”？","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"......哎，怎么回事？怎么打完就走了？","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"还有你刚刚怎么就给他们挪地方了？你真不怕他们酒后闹事？","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"你没看到他们放在门口的行囊吗？我认得他们两个。他们本来就是外面来的，这次离开玉门，就回老家了。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"这也是最后一次了，他们只是想在这里比一场，那就比上最后一场吧。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"该留不住的都是留不住的。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"不过......他们今天打得真的很尽兴。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"哦......","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"......","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"charslot","id":317},{"type":"text","text":"原来是这样的。","id":318},{"type":"text","text":"该留不住的都是留不住的。","id":319},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":321},{"type":"charslot","id":322},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":323},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/15/Avg_bg_35_g6_yumengate.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":324},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":325},{"type":"text","text":"一日后","id":326},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"截云，铸剑坊的事情......","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"......道理没有说错，但那天在铸剑坊，我的话说得太重了......","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"......唉，你要不要留在玉门？","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"我在这里有不少老友，不论你想干点什么，总能找到一个让你落脚的地方的。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#1$3","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"不用了。","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/56/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#9$3","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"师父都已经放下了，我也在这里真正地打了一架，很尽兴。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"middle","name":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1#9$3","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"我也准备离开这里了。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_4078_bdhkgt_1-9$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_799_1#1$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"荆先生","text":"你打算去哪里？","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F4/Avg_avg_npc_799_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"text","text":"截云没有回答，她走出了玉门城门，慢慢地唱起了一支歌。","id":345},{"type":"dialog","id":346},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":347},{"type":"charslot","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":349},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_bg_35_g11_yumendesert.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":350},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":351},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","volume":"1","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"太阳落下，明早还从东边升起来♪","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"月亮升起，明早会从西边落下去♪","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"戈壁上面的裂纹长满了，会有来年的雨水滋润它♪","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"沙漠深处的沙拐枣枯死了，会有地下的泉水救活它♪","id":357},{"type":"text","text":"一阵狂风刮过，裹挟着沙渠翻涌出来的滚滚黄沙，遮住了截云远去的背影。","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"我......","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"看看江南，也去尝尝菱角，见见师父说的那些，江湖上的人。","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"我想......自己四处走走，看看。","id":361},{"type":"dialogue","name":"截云","text":"看看什么才是真的可以让我像师父那样，记很久很久的人和事。","id":362},{"type":"dialog","id":363},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":364},{"type":"charslot","id":365},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":366},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BB/Avg_bg_35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_795_1#1$1","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军A","text":"左将军，我们来领罚。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6B/Avg_avg_npc_795_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"昨天值守期间擅自饮酒，按照军律，当罚军棍。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_788_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左宣辽","text":"......","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BB/Avg_avg_npc_788_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_796_1#1$1","id":375},{"type":"dialogue","name":"巡防营守军B","text":"封条也已经写好了，左将军，关铸剑坊的事......？","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B8/Avg_avg_npc_796_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_788_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":377},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左宣辽","text":"......这种事情，不需要再来问我了。","id":378,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BB/Avg_avg_npc_788_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_788_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":379},{"type":"dialogue","name":"左宣辽","text":"你们那时自己喝了那碗酒，你们可以自己做这个决定。","id":380,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BB/Avg_avg_npc_788_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":381},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":382},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":384},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":386},{"type":"character","id":387},{"type":"image","id":388}],"characters":["巡防营守军A","巡防营守军B","截云","荆先生","半酣的武人","醉酒的武人","清醒的武人","左宣辽"]}